          "number": 1,
          "step": "Whisk berbere spice blend, melted clarified butter, minced garlic, and grated ginger in a small bowl."
        },
        {
          "number": 2,
          "step": "Rub the spiced butter sauce evenly over bone-in chicken thighs, making sure to coat under the skin."
        },
        {
          "number": 3,
          "step": "Arrange thin red onion slices across the bottom of a rimmed metal baking sheet to form a flavor bed."
        },
        {
          "number": 4,
          "step": "Place seasoned chicken thighs on top of onion slices, skin side facing upward for maximum crisping."
        },
        {
          "number": 5,
          "step": "Roast at four hundred degrees Fahrenheit for thirty minutes until chicken skin is crispy and browned."
        },
        {
          "number": 6,
